PN,32706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F327A1786722499
OL,3,CHow and when to watch the solar
OL,4,Ceclipse in Cumbria and southern
OL,5,CScotland
OL,7,FIf you are planning on looking up at
OL,8,Fthe sky for the eclipse, experts have
OL,9,Fwarned that only special solar eclipse
OL,10,Fglasses that are ISO 12312-2 certified
OL,11,Ffor the safest eye protection should
OL,12,Fbe used.
OL,14,FWatch parties are taking place across
OL,15,Fthe region including at St Bees and
OL,16,FPenrith.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/6
